OL,3,GNEWSATravellers ordered to leave site
OL,4,Aearmarked for #100m art gallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has given permission for a
OL,7,Ftraveller family to be evicted from a
OL,8,Fsite earmarked as a new home for
OL,9,FScotland's national art collections in
OL,10,FEdinburgh.
OL,12,FLawyers for the Scottish government
OL,13,Fsaid the man, woman and 11 children,
OL,14,Falong with a number of "itinerant
OL,15,Fworkers" had "no right or entitlement"
OL,16,Fto occupy the future site of The Art
OL,17,FWorks project in Granton.
OL,19,FThe family argued that being removed
OL,20,Ffrom the site without a "culturally
OL,21,Fappropriate" alternative being provided
OL,22,Fwould breach their human rights.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
