OL,3,GNEWSATravellers ordered to leave site
OL,4,Aearmarked for #100m art gallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, in a judgement issued at the
OL,7,FCourt of Session, Lady Tait ordered the
OL,8,Ffamily to leave the site immediately
OL,9,Fand said the government's claim on the
OL,10,Fland was "legitimate".
